    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Wandering out onto the flat mud and sand outcroppings, we find more life.
    \n\nTrilobites scurry over the sea floor, scavenging for food. Trilobites were
    the most dominant animal that lived during the Cambrian.\n\nBut although they
    were the most dominant animal to live during this time, every organism has its
    time, and it's fall. Today, the trilobite, and all known relatives, are extinct. "
