  m_Text: 'Size: 1000 mm


    The largest predator that lived during the Cambrian. This beast was relatively
    enormous for the time, growing up to a meter in length. It was the apex predator
    of the Cambrian.


    It is an anomalacarid, a sister group to the arthropods.'
